Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Second Friend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 51
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He was resurrected after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You villain! Restore my body right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore them; let’s proceed with our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As if {\i1}you{\i0} could stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, save Planie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.25,0:01:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He vanished so suddenly—it must be…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Absorption Device!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll look after Planie; you guys go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And rescue Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Got the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Absorption Device?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:01:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let them catch up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.09,0:02:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You really thought this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If Blue regenerates…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the first thing he’ll do is look for the Absorption Device. We have to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But destroying that device triggers a massive explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.93,0:02:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only option is to throw it into a black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us will hold him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to use Green to stop us…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,…too bad. We know this place better than he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Green
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the welcome you give an old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, perhaps there’s another way to save our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s no use talking to him; he won’t listen at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink, you’ve always wanted to take my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, let’s save our world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You…you…Pink…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You come along too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There—now you’re back on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn’t even show us the way; we’re lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you always get in Blue’s way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Green, Blue is just using you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear, you can’t hold him that tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this—I’ll grab him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to catch me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t hurt Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he collapse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s take this chance to pull it out quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.81,0:05:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my body right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Green, you hurt my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t hurt them; I just trapped them temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry—once I fulfill my final wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll release your friends and leave your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not going to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I’ve done was for the sake of my friend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for his suggestion, I wouldn’t be able to run freely like this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A true friend won’t let you hurt others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you in such a rush to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we talk this over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to talk. We can proceed to the next step of the plan now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to work with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.81,0:06:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Don’t you want to save our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be a way that doesn’t involve sacrificing other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you’ve decided to work with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don’t blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll hold him off; you take care of the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve merged Pink and Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re simply working together in a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,work with someone like you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…a self-destruct sequence
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I just added a setting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.23,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If the device isn’t connected to my energy, it will explode
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s powerful enough to blow you to pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you’ll be blown to pieces too
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was already prepared to take you down with me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to be blown to pieces, throw the device in there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I have no other options?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stop me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.05,0:08:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, I’ve taken care of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They won’t be interfering with our plan for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You got the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Green, it’s all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a great friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:09:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can I give you a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my absolute best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Peach and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just about to take you to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, they are my third, fourth, and fifth most important friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking you to meet them, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, “taking me”?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They should feel honored to become a part of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.69,0:09:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you…absorb them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You encouraged me and gave me hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.81,0:09:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and said we were going to save the world together, didn’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I encouraged you back then because your power was useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let me go, Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re right, Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, he…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out Blue has been deceiving me all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to absorb me now to fuel his own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s already absorbed Pink, Brown, and Peach too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined Blue was that kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry for all the times I hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry…I’m truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,True friends wouldn’t make each other sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what a true friend is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t drag Paddi into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go—otherwise, you’ll get absorbed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My good friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Green!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The five of us can be together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it’s time to carry out the final step of my plan.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
